Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.23,0:22:20.65,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\c1E1E1E}也可爱无比
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.49,0:22:37.12,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}面对摇摆的蓝色烦扰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.12,0:22:40.88,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}面对诱惑魔法的引力
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.88,0:22:42.71,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}明明如此  如此
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.71,0:22:44.67,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}努力地抗拒着
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.67,0:22:46.17,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}可无论如何  不管怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.17,0:22:48.09,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}最终还是会败下阵来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.09,0:22:51.60,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\t(1000,2200,\cC22331)}如果现在能重新来过
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.60,0:22:55.10,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\cC22331}愿望如梦般短暂 {\fn\fscx\fscy}Rollin’
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.10,0:22:57.23,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\cC22331}但人生很长
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.23,0:23:01.52,EDCN,,0,0,27,,{\fad(180,180)\cC22331}偶尔迷茫又何妨{\fnA-OTF Shin Maru Go Pr6N DB\fs68}？
